{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20266RKug3H3791794461383.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>領展上半年度業績微升。截至九月底止，中期可分派總額按年升不足百分之1，至32.95億元。每單位中期分派127.25仙。</p><p></p><p>受內地及本港續租租金下調，以及宏觀環境及零售業受壓影響，整體物業收入淨額下跌百分之0.8。本港零售物業組合租用率九成七，較三月底回落0.8個百分點。期內續租租金減幅百分之7.5，減幅較去年同期擴大1.1個百分點。</p><p></p><p>集團表示，消費模式持續向線上轉移，加上電子商貿渠道不斷擴展，為傳統零售業態帶來進一步壓力。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T06:44:30.544689+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":212,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T05:29:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T08:52:01.428044+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T06:37:55.329548+00:00","content_hash":"f705d909f5f53e3c5ddfba7477d5c7a88493e1f36cccdba4c24c969277ee1927","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-12T06:44:30.544689+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}